    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>JVM EnclosingMethod attribute.</para><para>The EnclosingMethod attribute is a fixed-length attribute in the attributes table of a ClassFile structure (4.1). <ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> class must have an EnclosingMethod attribute if and only if it represents a local class or an anonymous class, see section 4.7.7 of the JVM specification. </para>    </detaileddescription>
